# Generators of the extraspecial group 2^(1+8)_- in its faithful irreducible
# 16-dimensional representation over GF(3).  It is the central product of
# three dihedral groups and one quaternion group of order 8 and has 239
# involutions.  Entries are read modulo 3, so 2 denotes -1.

